## 4. Container image

```bash
podman build -t {{package}} .
cp .env.example .env                    # then set WMS_DATABASE_URL in .env
podman run --rm --env-file .env {{package}}      # alembic upgrade head
podman run --rm --env-file .env {{package}} python -m {{package}}.seed
```

