## Upgrading the SDK

Never edit `wms_sdk/`: an upgrade replaces the whole folder. Someone with the new SDK installed runs, in this folder:

```bash
wms-sdk vendor
```

It keeps this project's features and prints the dependencies the new version needs; compare them with `requirements.txt`. Then read the SDK's release notes and create a migration (section 3).
